---
title: Host deposit top-up and commission (no online payment, no online top-up)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor H as Host owner
    actor A1 as Admin
    actor A2 as Second admin
    participant A as Django API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    H->>H: Transfers 50,000 DZD to the BLADUS CCP or bank account
    H->>A1: sends the transfer receipt
    A1->>A: POST /admin/wallets/{host_account_id}/topups (amount, method, receipt ref)
    A->>DB: unique check on method + receipt ref
    A->>DB: sum the host top-ups of the last 24 h (pending + approved + this one)
    alt rolling total up to 500,000 DZD
        A->>DB: approved, ledger cash debit / host wallet credit
    else above the threshold
        A->>DB: pending_approval
        A2->>A: POST /admin/topups/{topup_id}/approve
        Note over A2,A: the approver must differ from the requester
        A->>DB: approved, ledger postings
    end
    A-)H: deposit received notification
    Note over H,DB: a confirmed booking takes its commission from the deposit, and on a cancellation the commission follows the refund
